WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:11.920
¿Q-qué...?

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.200
What are you doing?

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.960
If you want to shoot someone...

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.040
First, you have to make sure

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.160
that the gun is loaded.

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:22.520
Then...

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:25.920
You aim at your target.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.560
And hold steady.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.880
And then you pull the trigger.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:37.480
Here.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.160
Try it now.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.280
Come on.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:47.120
Come on, kill me.

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.720
You think I can’t do it?
